      <refname>putline</refname>
      <refpurpose>向服务器套接字写一行 [DA]</refpurpose>
    </refnamediv>

    <refsynopsisdiv>
<synopsis>
putline(<replaceable>line</replaceable>)
</synopsis>

      <refsect2 id="R2-PYGRESQL-PUTLINE-1">
        <title>参数</title>
        <variablelist>
          <varlistentry>
            <term>
              <replaceable>line</replaceable>
            </term>
            <listitem>
              <para>要写的行（字符串）。</para>
            </listitem>
          </varlistentry>
        </variablelist>
      </refsect2>

      <refsect2 id="R2-PYGRESQL-PUTLINE-2">
        <title>返回类型</title>
          <para>none</para>
      </refsect2>

      <refsect2 id="R2-PYGRESQL-PUTLINE-3">
        <title>异常</title>
        <variablelist>
          <varlistentry>
            <term>
              <errorname>TypeError</errorname>
            </term>
            <listitem>
              <para>参数类型错误，或（任意）参数过多。</para>
            </listitem>
          </varlistentry>
          <varlistentry>
            <term>
              <errorname>pg.error</errorname>
            </term>
            <listitem>
              <para>无效的连接。</para>
            </listitem>
          </varlistentry>
        </variablelist>
      </refsect2>

    </refsynopsisdiv>

    <refsect1 id="R1-PYGRESQL-PUTLINE-1">
      <title>描述</title>
      <para><function>putline()</function> 方法允许直接向服务器套接字写一个字符串。</para>
    </refsect1>

  </refentry>

